@startuml
title Start a run and take it to ready for review

actor Operator
participant "avarice CLI" as CLI
database Ledger
participant "Source repository" as Source
participant Supervisor
participant "Run clone" as Clone
participant "GSD tools" as GSD
participant "Claude Code host" as Host
participant "PreToolUse hook" as Hook
participant "Check commands" as Checks

== Start: every rule is judged before anything is stored ==
Operator -> CLI : start with a brief, policy routine
alt policy is not routine, GSD not admitted, brief invalid, or no usable project
  CLI --> Operator : usage error (64) or refusal (3), nothing stored
end
CLI -> Source : read HEAD, history since the onboarded revision,\nconventions and roadmap, all from repository objects
alt a start rule fails (revision mismatch, not a descendant, too many\nor too old commits, no conventions, no roadmap)
  CLI --> Operator : refusal (3), nothing stored
end
CLI -> CLI : compile the contract (narrows only), static gate G0
alt compile fails, static G0 fails, or a budget override is invalid
  CLI --> Operator : usage error (64), nothing stored
end
CLI -> Ledger : one transaction: run, contract v1, budgets, work item A
note right of Ledger : run is contract_ready
CLI -> CLI : write the contract file (temporary file, then rename)
CLI -> Ledger : step start:preflight
CLI -> Supervisor : spawn detached (own process group)
CLI -> Ledger : step supervisor:spawn (PID)
CLI --> Operator : one-screen summary, exit 0 (with --wait: follow the run)

== Supervisor: lease and preparation ==
Supervisor -> Ledger : take the lease
Supervisor -> Ledger : rewrite the contract file if it is missing
Supervisor -> Ledger : resume prelude (nothing to reap on a fresh run)
loop each preparation action whose step is not yet completed
  Supervisor -> Ledger : checkpoint (before the side effect)
end
Supervisor -> Clone : local clone at the onboarded revision, branch for the run
Supervisor -> GSD : apply the run settings
Supervisor -> Checks : install dependencies (declared registry hosts only)
Supervisor -> Checks : validate every declared check in a scratch clone
Supervisor -> Checks : baseline: required checks at the onboarded revision
Supervisor -> Ledger : the baseline opens the first attempt
alt a decision or a containment condition in one of these actions
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision
else host does not report enforcement as enforced (dynamic G0)
  Supervisor -> Ledger : run blocked_on_decision (enforcement failure), no decision record
else everything passes
  Supervisor -> Ledger : G0 gate row, run moves to running
end

== The unit ==
Supervisor -> Ledger : checkpoint, context pack step (references and digest only)
Supervisor -> Ledger : item ready to delegated
Supervisor -> Clone : snapshot
Supervisor -> Ledger : snapshot step
alt a budget is spent
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision (budget exhausted), host never called
else
  Supervisor -> Ledger : reserve an invocation, launch step started (session ID)
end
Supervisor -> Host : launch /gsd-quick (detached, sandboxed)
Host -> Hook : every tool call
Hook -> Ledger : decision event, charge tool calls and subagents
Host -> Clone : edit files
Host --> Supervisor : final result
Supervisor -> Ledger : settle the budget, launch step completed
Supervisor -> Clone : measure HEAD, changes since the snapshot, quick records
Supervisor -> Ledger : classify step (from measured facts, not model text)
alt not progressed
  note over Supervisor, Ledger : crash or timeout with HEAD unmoved: discard and retry once\n(see the discard and retry diagram);\nany other ending: decision record, run blocked_on_decision
else progressed
  Supervisor -> Ledger : item implemented
end

== Gate G2 and the commit ==
Supervisor -> Checks : required checks on the working tree\n(only when every other G2 rule passed)
Supervisor -> Ledger : evidence rows, G2 gate row
alt G2 fails
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision
else G2 passes
  Supervisor -> Ledger : item gated
  Supervisor -> Ledger : archive the quick records as artifacts
  Supervisor -> Clone : restore or remove every artifact path
  Supervisor -> Clone : commit the in-scope paths only, with run and attempt trailers
  Supervisor -> Ledger : commit step, item done, run moves to verifying
end

== Final proof and hand-off ==
Supervisor -> Checks : required and target checks at the committed revision
Supervisor -> Ledger : evidence rows, plus the GSD verdict as model review\n(never satisfies a criterion)
Supervisor -> Ledger : G4 gate row
alt G4 fails
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision
else G4 passes
  Supervisor -> Source : fetch the run branch (create-only, never forced)
  alt the branch exists at another commit
    Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record (scope expansion), run blocked_on_decision
  else created, or already at the same commit
    Supervisor -> Ledger : hand-off step and event, attempt handed-off
    Supervisor -> Ledger : run moves to ready_for_review
  end
end
Supervisor -> Ledger : release the lease, exit 0 at ready_for_review
Operator -> CLI : status or inbox (read only)
note over Source : nothing is pushed or merged,\nthe user's checkout is never written
@enduml
